Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.09,0:16:02.73,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HAE85E8&}折れない
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:05.37,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&H44FFF6&}ぬげない
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:09.81,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HC6EA2A&}これが私たち
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.14,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&H44FFF6&}夢を {\c&HC6EA2A&}Fight on！{\c&HAE85E8&}Fight on！{\c&H44FFF6&}Fight on！{\clip(0,0,1920,97)}
