Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:20.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}震える足 揺れる心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:24.04,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}不安だらけの日々
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.82,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}大きな使命に
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:30.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}何回も溺れそうになっても
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:33.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}大切な人たちがいる
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:37.30,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}守りたい世界がある
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:40.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}思いが強く背中を押した
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:46.94,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}迷わずに信じて進めばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:50.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}後ろは振り返らずに
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:54.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}前を向いて 空を見上げ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:58.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}太陽と目を合わせ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:04.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}どんな運命も 必ず最後は まぶしく輝くから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:08.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}私たちはひとりじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:12.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}やさしくて あたたかい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:15.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}音楽が結んだ奇跡で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:17.26,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}歌おう
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:18.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}一緒に
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:21.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}明日へ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:23.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}君と
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:25.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}つなぐ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDroid Sans Fallback\fs50}オーケストラ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:20.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}震顫的腳 搖擺的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:24.04,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}充滿不安的每天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.82,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}無數次即將淹於
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:30.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}艱巨的使命之中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:33.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}有親朋好友們在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:37.30,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}有想守護的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:40.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}信念猛地推動我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:46.94,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}不用迷茫 相信自己 向前進吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:50.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}無須反顧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:54.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}看著天 向前跑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:58.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}太陽和眼睛對上了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:04.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}無論何種命運 都會在其最後 綻放耀眼光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:08.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我們並不孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:12.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}相互扶持 相互溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:15.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}以音樂相繫的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:17.26,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}放聲高歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:18.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:21.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}向著明日
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:23.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}與你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:25.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}協奏的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an8}管弦樂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:40.53,ED,,0,0,0,,慢慢地來 不要焦急
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:43.78,ED,,0,0,0,,尋找出答案
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:45.57,ED,,0,0,0,,不可以說謊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:50.16,ED,,0,0,0,,直率的感情 才值得重視
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:53.46,ED,,0,0,0,,總會有失去自信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:57.04,ED,,0,0,0,,想要逃避的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:58.57,ED,,0,0,0,,沒有關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:03.59,ED,,0,0,0,,只要能夠 一往直前 竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:10.51,ED,,0,0,0,,做好我能辦到的事 提高了嗓門向前進
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:14.64,ED,,0,0,0,,盡情地哭 儘管消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:18.27,ED,,0,0,0,,會讓自己變得更強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.27,0:22:24.65,ED,,0,0,0,,不會有問題的 就我們好姐妹 弱小也是伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:28.24,ED,,0,0,0,,放聲吶喊吧 內心的深處
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:31.83,ED,,0,0,0,,力量已經覺醒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:35.37,ED,,0,0,0,,振翅高飛吧 心情愉快地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:37.00,ED,,0,0,0,,永遠會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.25,0:22:38.63,ED,,0,0,0,,陪伴在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.46,ED,,0,0,0,,你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:43.46,ED,,0,0,0,,夢想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:45.22,ED,,0,0,0,,能實現
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:47.42,ED,,0,0,0,,絕對會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
